    "detailed_description": "Climb towers with platforms, enemies and traps present in two different dimensions, between which You swap with one press of a button. Complete journey including eight different levels with increasing level of difficulty or jump into the Endless Tower mode and try scoring the highest possible score. Whatever you choose we hope You have fun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056190/extras/e538e7ce7c7d994c33a53699c5ccd503.avif?t=1663232638\" /></div><br><br>With each tower, You will face a new type of danger:<br><br>- Smaller platforms<br>- Moving platforms<br>- Fireballs<br>- Ice lasers<br>- Fire and ice monsters<br>- Changing speed of the game",
    "about_the_game": "Climb towers with platforms, enemies and traps present in two different dimensions, between which You swap with one press of a button. Complete journey including eight different levels with increasing level of difficulty or jump into the Endless Tower mode and try scoring the highest possible score. Whatever you choose we hope You have fun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056190/extras/e538e7ce7c7d994c33a53699c5ccd503.avif?t=1663232638\" /></div><br><br>With each tower, You will face a new type of danger:<br><br>- Smaller platforms<br>- Moving platforms<br>- Fireballs<br>- Ice lasers<br>- Fire and ice monsters<br>- Changing speed of the game",
    "short_description": "Dimwarper is an Icy Tower type of platformer, where You play as a mysterious character, who gained an ability to swap between two dimensions. Your task is to climb seven towers, controlled by seven wizards with different powers. This journey will require from You great focus and speed. Good luck!",
